# Leave text to core.autocrlf, matching the website repo. scripts/sync-web.mjs
# is a byte copy into website/ware/sprite-forge/; pinning anything here to LF
# would make the website report every synced file as modified while `git diff`
# shows nothing, burying the one file that actually changed.
* text=auto

*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.ico binary
